An append onto a scalar key fails the run with exit 1, naming the key on stderr; the file is untouched.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: Probe plan
---

Body.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md --append title=other
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: cannot append to scalar key 'title' in plan.md
-- exit --
1
